WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:02.041
- Do you suddenly have a lot of time on your hands?

00:00:02.125 --> 00:00:04.375
THEN COME ON DOWN TO Camp Loseabigamo.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:05.375
Please come get me.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.458
- Little Truss, boo hoo.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.416
- CAMP LOSEABIGAMO, HAVE YOU HEARD THE NEWS?

00:00:10.416 --> 00:00:12.166
THAT’S RIGHT, SPORTS FANS,

00:00:12.166 --> 00:00:14.041
IT’S ACTUALLY COOL TO LOSE. 

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:16.416
- [Together:] WE’RRRREEE LOSERS!

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:18.208
- With activities such as...

00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:20.333
- WHERE THE F--K IS THE FLAG?!?!

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:21.583
- MAKE ME FLY, KYLER!

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:25.458
- Do you guys think we’ll ever be too old 
to play games all day?

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:27.791
- I made a friendship bracelet.

00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:30.833
- We've got the lead, just keep spinning, baby!

00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:33.041
- They have talent, they're just using it weird. 

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.583
- I’m homesick for the playoffs.

00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:37.666
- US TOOOO…

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:38.666
- I’ll be your friend…

00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:40.375
- LOOK, I MAY BE COVERED IN GADDUMB GLITTER

00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:41.875
BUT AT LEAST I FLUFFIN' TRY.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.541
- So, I turn the corner and what do I see?

00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:45.250
It's a team that's solid on defense... 

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.000
AND OFFENSE.

00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:47.666
- Kittle, taste the pain, bro!

00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:48.166
- [Together:] AHHHHHH!

00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:49.500
- Hey, lights off!

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.916
- I WANT TO BE UNDER THE LIGHTS A
LITTLE LONGER.

00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:55.875
- Or spend all your time sadly staring at the 
championship camp across the lake.

00:00:56.125 --> 00:00:57.416
- WAH, you're too big, Derrick!

00:00:57.666 --> 00:00:58.708
- CAMP FRIENDS AREN’T REAL FRIENDS.

00:00:58.833 --> 00:00:59.833
- TRACTORCITO!

